  {
   "id": "emergency-room-simulator-253606@major-2026-09-01",
   "gameId": "emergency-room-simulator-253606",
   "displayName": "Second Update Available Now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-01T08:13:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44211198/6392b2cbcf8b6b01ea2f7fc8a2ee4d8239afa165.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "today we're releasing Update 2 for Emergency Room Simulator. Thank you for all your feedback, bug reports, and suggestions. One of your main concerns was that you weren’t receiving the more complex cases quickly enough. Therefore, this update focuses on case variety, progression and user guidance. The next update will be a little more extensive and will make the hospital a bit busier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the latest patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Reworked rank system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Revised illness case availability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Next steps are now displayed correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Information about ranks and the availability of new illness cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Change details",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Reworked Rank System",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've adjusted the XP requirements for progression, allowing players to level up and reach new ranks more quickly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More Variety in Illness Cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many players reported receiving the same cases repeatedly. To address this, we have updated the case selection system:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there are illness cases you have not encountered yet, they will now be prioritized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All illness cases can appear earlier during progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More challenging and advanced cases will also become available much sooner.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Correct Next-Step Display",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In some situations, the objective display in the top-right corner did not show the correct next action. This issue has now been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Progression Information",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players will now receive additional information about rank progression and that this unlocks new illness cases. This information can be viewed in several places, including the tablet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support and feedback. We are committed to improving Emergency Room Simulator and look forward to hearing your thoughts on this update. Enjoy playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
